# Shell scripts and container/HA config must keep LF line endings.
# With core.autocrlf=true (the default on Windows) these would otherwise be
# checked out with CRLF, and a script whose shebang ends in \r fails on Linux
# with "bad interpreter: No such file or directory".
*.sh              text eol=lf
*.yml             text eol=lf
*.yaml            text eol=lf
*.yaml.disabled   text eol=lf
Dockerfile        text eol=lf
